    q: 'Which job title should I target first inside data analytics if I am just starting out?',
    a: 'Data analyst or BI analyst, in almost every case. Both sit in the descriptive-and-diagnostic layer of the field, which is where the vast majority of entry-level hiring actually happens, and both build the SQL and dashboard foundation that every senior lane — consulting, analytics management, or a move toward data science — is later built on.',
  },
